[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12620.32, "timestamp": "03:30:20", "text": "我失去了希望。我到底想做什麼？  呃，如何建造一座塔。塔長什麼樣？幻想之塔。塔長什麼樣？  塔。  塔。  斯納。大廈。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12631.469, "timestamp": "03:30:31", "text": "等等，mansion 的拼寫是什麼？  大廈。拼寫是這樣嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12641.15, "timestamp": "03:30:41", "text": "我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12646.429, "timestamp": "03:30:46", "text": "知道。  [音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12657.51, "timestamp": "03:30:57", "text": "嗯，"}]